# Allowlist global level paket (ENGINEERING §2.3 E-10), diverifikasi TestGlobalAllowlist.
# Format satu baris: <path>:<identifier> <alasan>
#   <path>       = file Go relatif root repo, pemisah '/' (mis. internal/modules/registry.go)
#   <identifier> = nama var level paket yang diberi `//nolint:gochecknoglobals // <alasan>`
#   <alasan>     = wajib, kategori dari daftar E-10 (registry modules, data embedded read-only, …)
# Baris '#' dan kosong diabaikan. Maks 10 baris; setiap baris harus masih punya nolint-nya
# (baris basi = gagal), dan setiap nolint gochecknoglobals harus punya baris di sini.
internal/modules/registry.go:defaultRegistry registry modul statis (E-10 allowlist)
internal/assemble/golden_helpers_test.go:update test-only golden flag
internal/tools/golden_test.go:updateGolden test-only golden update flag
internal/tools/golden_test.go:goldenCases table of golden cases
internal/compaction/compaction_test.go:update test-only golden flag
internal/e2e/harness_test.go:binPaths test-only child binary paths
cmd/damnbot/global.go:activeInvocation process-wide --profile of one CLI invocation (single writer: run)
internal/provider/registry/catalog.go:defaultCatalog data embedded read-only, parsed once (E-10 allowlist)
